            "a",
            VoiceSpec.npc(NpcRace.ELF, NpcGender.FEMALE),
            Emotion.NEUTRAL,
            TestFixtures.TROLL_PROFILE,
            false,
            false);

    String variant = backend.cacheVariant(humanMale);
    assertTrue(
        "the variant carries the fixed model id so no future model switch can replay its audio",
